{"info": {"address1": "ITPB Road", "address2": "Whitefield", "city": "Bengaluru", "zip": "560048", "country": "India", "phone": "91 80 2297 9123", "fax": "91 80 2841 1474", "website": "https://www.tataelxsi.com", "industry": "Software - Application", "industryKey": "software-application", "industryDisp": "Software - Application", "sector": "Technology", "sectorKey": "technology", "sectorDisp": "Technology", "longBusinessSummary": "Tata Elxsi Limited provides product design and engineering, systems integration, and support services in India, the United States, Europe, and Internationally. The company operates through two segments, Systems Integration and Support, and Software Development and Services. It offers AIVA, an AI-based video analytics platform that automates video tagging, object detection, content indexing, and metadata generation; and iCX, a SaaS-based solution for automating, monitoring, and managing CPEs. It also provides QoEtient, a platform for video streaming services; TEPlay, an OTT/IPTV platform; Neuron, an autonomous network platform for telco operators; and uLike, a platform for AI-powered content recommendation engine. In addition, it offers TETHER, a cloud-based platform for vehicle connectivity; eMobility HILS, a scalable solution for validating electric vehicle systems; Robo-Taxi, a platform for autonomous ride-hailing; AVENIR, a platform for real-time data processing, validation, and integration for software defined vehicles; AutonomAI, an AI-driven platform for self-driving capabilities; and MOBIUS+, a blockchain-powered solution. Further, it provides TEDREG, a regulatory intelligence platform for compliance management; Digital Health Platform, a customizable platform for remote patient monitoring, virtual consultations, and personalized health insights; TEngage, a digital health platform for patient engagement tools with customizable workflows, interactive communication channels, and performance tracking dashboards; TEDAX Big Data, an AI-driven analytics platform; and TEcare, a care management platform for multi-channel support and care plan customization. It serves automotive, broadcast and media, communications, off-highway equipment, healthcare and life sciences, appliances and consumer electronics, rail, semiconductor, and aerospace industries. The company was incorporated in 1989 and is headquartered in Bengaluru, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Manoj  Raghavan", "age": 54, "title": "MD, CEO & Director", "yearBorn": 1971, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 85256000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Gaurav  Bajaj", "title": "Chief Financial Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Sneha  V", "title": "Company Secretary & Compliance Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Pai  Nitin B.E. (Hons)", "age": 54, "title": "CMO & Chief Strategy Officer", "yearBorn": 1971, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Vasant  Shah", "age": 60, "title": "Global Head of Business Finance", "yearBorn": 1965, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Nick  Talbot", "title": "Global Head of Design & Innovation", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Dr. Sajiv  Madhavan", "title": "Chief Risk & Sustainability Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Bhaskar  Dutt", "title": "Global Head of Strategic Relations", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Narendra  Ghate", "title": "Chief Designer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Rajesh  Kumar B.Tech.", "age": 64, "title": "Vice President of Strategic Initiatives", "yearBor